This product implements the Linked Open Knowledge Format (LOKF) specification: https://lokf.nolan-nichols.com/specification/

LOKF is a semantic profile of the Open Knowledge Format (OKF) specification by Google Cloud Platform:
https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/knowledge-catalog/blob/main/okf/SPEC.md

LOKF Registrar checks the LOKF semantic layer and the OKF v0.2 base rules it subsumes, in the editor. It is the sibling of LOKF Curator, which records a person's verdicts; neither depends on the other.
